# Line-ending policy: every text file is stored as LF and checked out as LF on
# all platforms. Without `eol=lf` the Windows CI runner forces CRLF checkouts
# (core.autocrlf) and `prettier --check` flags every source file as mis-formatted
# (Frontend (windows-latest) Format check was red for this exact reason).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Binary assets (and anything git may otherwise mis-detect as text) are never
# line-ending normalized and never diffed as text.
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.opus binary
*.flac binary
*.aiff binary
apps/desktop/src-tauri/vendor/libmpv/windows/libmpv-2.dll filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
